# MPPE requirements curriculum (`/eoschool/requirements/curriculum`)

This route is a **separate product surface** from Homescool workspace classes. Do **not** apply `homescool-class-method-v*`, letter-grid `slotSequence`, or `.eoschool` Homescool documents here unless the user explicitly asks to merge products.

## Authority

1. **MPPE Venezuela (3.er grado)** — marco, consulta de contenidos, plan 40 semanas / 200 días: `ministerio_de_educacion_de_venezuela/`, `eoschool-mppe-40week-curriculum.json`.
2. **Homescool / eoschool METHOD** applies only to `/homescool/*` and published `.eoschool` media — not to this route.

## School calendar + VE holidays

- Plan day 1 = **2026-09-21** (Monday); 200 Mon–Fri days → end **2027-06-25**.
- Meta: `schoolYearStart`, `schoolYearEnd`, `holidays[]` (`planDay`, `date`, `name`).
- Official holidays (LOTTT + Fiestas Nacionales, fixed + Carnaval/Semana Santa) that fall on a school day → `dayKind: "holiday"`, `scheduledSections: ["bib"]` only (overrides teach/exposition).
- `len` / `mat` / `ide` / `cie` are redistributed onto non-holiday slots so unique learnings are not dropped. Do not renumber `dN`.

## Weekly subject rotation

Within each week (day-in-week 1–5), unless holiday:

| Day | Sections | Notes |
| --- | --- | --- |
| 1, 3 | `bib`, `len`, `ide`, `cie` | Teach |
| 2, 4 | `bib`, `len`, `mat` | Teach |
| 5 | `bib`, `ide`, `len`, `mat`, `cie` | **Exposition** — rehearse week focus; no new teach buckets |
| holiday | `bib` | Feriado nacional — solo Biblia |

Progress keys stay `dN:sectionId` (no renumbering / no Mongo migration). Day complete = all **scheduled** sections that day (not always 5/5).

## Day content format (required)

Static JSON per plan day:

- Path: `frontend/public/eoschool/requirements/curriculum/day-sheets/d{N}.mppe-day.json`
- `format`: `"mppe-curriculum-day"` (not `"eoschool"`)
- Fields: `dayKind` (`teach` \| `exposition` \| `holiday`), `scheduledSections`, `sections[]` (only scheduled ids); holiday sheets may include `holidayName` / `calendarDate`
- Each section: `objective`, `learning`, `activities` (2 items), optional `mode` / `canDo` / `activityKind`
- Exposition Friday: `mode: "exposition"`; holiday: `mode: "holiday"`

Regenerate: `node frontend/scripts/build-40week-mppe-curriculum.mjs` then `node frontend/scripts/build-mppe-day-sheets.mjs`. Forward-fill learnings **within** each subject’s non-holiday teaching days only.

Manifest: `day-sheets-manifest.json` (not `plan-classes-manifest.json` / not per-subject `.eoschool.json`).

## UI

- **Card:** only scheduled subjects that day; **modal:** tabs for scheduled sections + materiales.
- **PDF:** one letter page with **3 / 4 / 5 cards** by section count (not always 5), via API MPPE — not `/api/homescool/preview`.
- **Materiales (modal, por tab/asignatura):** roles `teacher_guide` | `child` | `proof`; kinds `image` | `audio` | `document` | `url`. Scope: `owner + studentKey + dayId + sectionId`.
- **Treat (al marcar sección completa):** modal de celebración con confeti + chiste/adivinanza. Corpus: `frontend/src/data/homescool/jokes-riddles-1000.json` (keys `dN:section`, 1000 ítems); regenerar con `scripts/generate_homescool_jokes_riddles.py`.

## API

- `POST /api/eoschool/curriculum/day-preview` — body = full `mppe-curriculum-day` JSON → PDF base64 (variable cards).
- Progress Mongo: `/api/eoschool/curriculum/progress*` (por niño; default Elías). Keys `dN:bib|ide|len|mat|cie` unchanged.
- Materials (cookie + Homescool entitlement + CSRF on writes):
  - `GET /api/eoschool/curriculum/materials?studentKey=&dayId=&sectionId=`
  - `POST /api/eoschool/curriculum/materials` (multipart file + role + optional title/description)
  - `POST /api/eoschool/curriculum/materials/url` (JSON https URL + optional title/description)
  - `PATCH /api/eoschool/curriculum/materials/{id}` (title + description)
  - `DELETE /api/eoschool/curriculum/materials/{id}`
  - `GET …/materials/{id}/file` and `…/thumb`
- Max **4 items per role** (`teacher_guide` | `child` | `proof`) within a day+section (`material_limit_reached`).
- Images: convert with Homescool progress WebP pipeline (quality 82); originals are not retained on disk.
- Audio (mpeg/mp4/wav/ogg/webm) and documents (PDF/ODT/DOCX) stored as uploaded bytes under `{MEDIA_ROOT}/eoschool/curriculum/…`.
- No extra VPS/Nginx setup: reuse existing `MEDIA_ROOT` + `ServeFile`.

## Forbidden on this route

- Generating or requiring Homescool `lesson.kind`, `quiz`, `slotSequence`, or `layout: letter-grid-v2` for MPPE day sheets.
- Using `POST /api/homescool/preview` for the curriculum day modal PDF.
- Copying Homescool week themes as the spine instead of the 40-week MPPE plan data.
- Embedding section materials into the day PDF unless explicitly requested.
- Renaming section ids or renumbering plan days (breaks progress tracking).

## When editing

1. Subdivide saberes según el plan 40×200 y el patrón semanal, no hardcodear 28 semanas ni “siempre 5 materias”.
2. Keep activities age-appropriate (3.er grado).
3. After JSON changes, rebuild day sheets and smoke-test PDF preview + modal.
